        <mxCell id="GroupDomainEvents" parent="G" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#EEE8FB;strokeColor=#6A4FB3;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:5px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;«Domain Events»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;GroupDomainEvents&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;GroupCreated&lt;br/&gt;MemberInvited&lt;br/&gt;MemberJoined&lt;br/&gt;MemberLeft&lt;br/&gt;MemberRemoved&lt;br/&gt;MemberPromoted&lt;br/&gt;InvitationDeclined&lt;br/&gt;GroupClosedForSettlement&lt;br/&gt;GroupReopened&lt;br/&gt;GroupArchived&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="196" x="1029" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="noteInvite" parent="G" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFDF2;strokeColor=#B8A77A;" value="&lt;b&gt;Decision 17.10: invitations go through the root&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;What: Group.acceptInvitation() checks that the group is OPEN and the user is not yet a member, calls invitation.accept() (PENDING, not expired), adds the Membership and publishes MemberJoined. declineInvitation() works the same way. Invitation keeps accept() / decline(), but they only change its status.&lt;br/&gt;Why: aggregate rule 1 (DDD slide 67): rules that involve several parts are protected via the root. Events are published by the aggregate (slide 71), not by an inner entity." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="300" x="1029" y="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
